  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7402.01 New Hampshire Patient Care Protocols",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7402.01 New Hampshire Patient Care Protocols. All emergency medical providers licensed pursuant to Saf-C 5900 shall follow the current New Hampshire Statewide Patient Care Protocols as set forth at: https://www.fstems.dos.nh.gov/ems-systems/patient-care-protocols.\n\nSource. #12682, EXEMPT, eff 11-28-18; ss by #13359, EXEMPT, eff 3-24-22\n\nAPPENDIX A",
